        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Temporal Interval",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) An order must not have the effect that a term of imprisonment imposed on a person for a Commonwealth child sex offence be served partly cumulatively, or concurrently, with an uncompleted term of imprisonment..."
