      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Court must consider age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the offence was committed.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) In determining the sentence to be passed, or the order to be made, respect of a person for an offence against this Subdivision, the court must take into account the following matters:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-474-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Court must consider number of people involved in commission of offence.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the number of people involved in the commission of the offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-474-ss-1-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Maturity is a relevant factor in determining sentence.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "RECURSIVE",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) if that person was under 10 when the offence was committed—that fact as a reason for aggravating the seriousness of the criminal behaviour to which the offence relates;"
    },
